'''Barrier''' was a {{Rare}} [[Natural]]-type [[Blox Fruit]] that used to cost {{Money|800,000}} or {{Robux|1,250}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]].

The Barrier Fruit granted the user the ability to create and manifest green barriers that blocked attacks, trapped foes, ambushed enemies, and damaged opponents that got hit by it. The user could create green structures such as towers and stairs to elevate them.

Barrier was highly useful for trolling, as the user could block other players' paths—for example, by blocking the entrance of the [[Mansion (Third Sea)|Mansion]] at [[Floating Turtle]], the portal created by [[Portal]] V, or the [[Cursed Ship]]. Barrier was a mid-tier PvP fruit and okay for grinding, since the Z move allowed you to be immune to damage from M1s, while being able to hit through them yourself.

