==Overview==
<tabber>
Pros=
{{Overview|Pros
|'''General'''
* Good for trolling.
* Easy to obtain.
* Decent for controlling the area and fighting.
* Good defense against ranged attacks.
* Decent damage.

|'''[Z] Barrier Wall'''
* M1s could hit through, making it really effective grinding with [[Fighting Styles|melee]] or [[swords]].
* Could be used as a counter just like [[Dough]]'s {{Ability|Dough|Z}} Move.
* Could ragdoll enemies by being directly above them when hitting them.
* Reset [[Air Jump]]s in mid-air, allowing the user to [[Dashing|dash]] more across the [[Water]].
* Could hit other players into [[lava]].

|'''[X] Surprise Attack'''
* Can be used as a free escape move.

|'''[C] Barrier Prison'''
* The user gained immunity to all types of damage while inside the green sphere.
* Could be used to drag a fruit user into the [[water]] or [[lava]].
* Could be used to trap an [[NPC]] and slam it into another.

|'''[V] Barrier Towers'''
* Not too hard to aim.
* Could be used as a blocking wall.
* The stun ability is quite annoying for players.

|'''[F] Stairs'''
* The player could reset [[Air Jump]] in mid-air, allowing Barrier users to [[Dashing|dash]] more across the [[water]].
}}

|-|Cons=
{{Overview|Cons
|'''General'''
* Low damage.
* Not great in horizontal movement.
* Decent endlag.

|'''[Z] Barrier Wall'''
* Could be used as a standing ground. (If the enemy took advantage of it)

|'''[X] Surprise Attack'''
* Not good in enclosed spaces. (Although it still works as a teleportation move, making it effective when trying to escape through walls)

|'''[C] Barrier Prison'''
* Not the best against people who had an arsenal of mobility moves. (Due to them being able to dodge it more consistently)

|'''[V] Barrier Towers'''
* Did not work properly inside places with low ceilings.
* Hard to hit in [[PvP]] as the barriers took a relatively long time to place.

|'''[F] Stairs'''
* Generally slower than walking, as the player had to wait for the next step to be created.
}}
</tabber>

